da6f217fa2b3a39992cb75afbdce087680291c4618b676142d2769674":{"role":"assistant","content":"### Checkpoint 100 Update\n\nExploration has reached **Checkpoint 100** (100 frames acquired out of 200).\n\n#### Exploration Summary (Frames 81–100)\n1. **West Ward Survey (Frames 81–86):**\n   - Turned westward and translated along $Y \\approx 4.54$ m toward $X \\approx -1.69$ m.\n   - Captured close-up views of `potted_plant_1` and `cabinet_1` in `obs_0085`.\n2. **South-Central Loop (Frames 87–93):**\n   - Moved southward along $X \\approx -1.69$ m past `potted_plant_1` to $Y \\approx 2.54$ m.\n   - Surveyed the southern wall and cabinet footprint.\n3. **Cross-Room Transit to East Side (Frames 94–100):**\n   - Headed east ($90^\\circ$) across the room from $X \\approx -1.69$ m to $X \\approx 0.81$ m at $Y \\approx 2.54$ m.\n   - Re-observed `table_1` and the South-East corner in `obs_0099` and `obs_0100`.\n\n#### Object Coordinates & Status\nAll 8 objects in the synthetic room have been multi-view triangulated and confirmed:\n- `potted_plant_1` (`potted plant`): $(-2.55, 3.87)$\n- `cabinet_1` (`cabinet`): $(-2.65, 1.30)$\n- `sofa_1` (`sofa`): $(-2.59, 6.67)$\n- `chair_1` (`chair`): $(-0.63, 5.35)$\n- `floor_lamp_1` (`floor lamp`): $(0.87, 3.14)$\n- `table_1` (`table`): $(2.65, 1.53)$\n- `bottle_1` (`bottle`): $(2.34, 3.98)$\n- `stool_1` (`stool`): $(2.55, 6.17)$\n\nThe metric map file `/work/map.json` has been updated with evidence references and `stop_reason: \"checkpoint\"`."},"b3e946e07249b8123698dbdeba1dd8ef9b8a87f9f4c0b2949724fb828def6439":{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"toolu_a3287090f0354fed9222c190a98de5b4","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"/work/observations/obs_0028.png\"}"}}]},"b3a38bd7cf3226d75476870989419b9d79eb5521437dc0e1436a0e2f47015796":{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"toolu_e83ea384794246a4998fd1433cdb1446","content":"total 73\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 root root  1024 Sep 11 15:14 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 14 root root   280 Sep 11 15:14 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 root root  1024 Sep 11 15:14 .claude\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root 12316 Sep 11 15:21 history.jsonl\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root  8192 Sep 11 15:21 observations"},"b33c51aa0924644c6d20f0964bcc71c3705110fcdcdfb9d09c819aacacdcb552":{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"toolu_01b7b0b6d57345cf9ae4bf4ea04d5b91","type":"function","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -c \\\"\\nimport math\\ndef ground_pt(u, v, cam_x, cam_y, cam_yaw):\\n    H = 1.55\\n    d_fwd = H * 256.0 / (v - 256.0)\\n    d_right = H * (u - 256.0) / (v - 256.0)\\n    rad = math.radians(cam_yaw)\\n    wx = cam_x + d_fwd * math.sin(rad) + d_right * math.cos(rad)\\n    wy = cam_y + d_fwd * math.cos(rad) - d_right * math.sin(rad)\\n    return wx, wy\\n\\n# obs20: cam_x=-0.5, cam_y=2.0, yaw=0.0\\n# mid u = (211+250)/2 = 230.5, v = 390\\np = ground_pt(230.5, 390, -0.5, 2.0, 0.0)\\nprint('Stool center from obs20:', p)\\n\\\"\", \"description\": \"Compute stool center from obs 20\"}"}}]},"b3242dcb9f26b8469fb7dc33f4fa83d2fc053d25fcb66b607139a77e3d3af66e":{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"toolu_16914d2c659141fd851e611e2e7cf27e","type":"function","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -c \\\"\\nimport numpy as np\\nfrom PIL import Image\\n\\nim6 = np.array(Image.open('/work/observations/obs_0006.png'))\\n# Frame 6 pose:\\n# Let's check poses for frame 6\\n# frame 1: (0,0,0)\\n# frame 2: (0,0,90)\\n# frame 3: (0,0,180)\\n# frame 4: (0,0,270)\\n# frame 5: turn 90 -> yaw 0, move 0.5 -> (0, 0.5, 0)\\n# frame 6: turn 0 -> yaw 0, move 0.5 -> (0, 1.0, 0)\\n\\n# In obs6, cabinet front-right corner and back-right corner on the floor:\\n# The cabinet white side wall touches floor at u ~ 345 to 420\\n# Let's find white pixels near floor\\nmask_cab_white = (im6[:,:,0] > 180) & (im6[:,:,1] > 180) & (im6[:,:,2] > 180)\\n# Cabinet side is u in [340, 420]\\ncoords = np.argwhere(mask_cab_white)\\ncab_side = coords[(coords[:,1] >= 340) & (coords[:,1] <= 425) & (coords[:,0] > 300)]\\n# bottom edge:\\nimport pandas as pd\\ndf = pd.DataFrame(cab_side, columns=['v', 'u'])\\nbottoms = df.groupby('u')['v'].max()\\nprint('Front bottom corner (max v):', bottoms.idxmax(), bottoms.max())\\nprint('Back bottom corner (min u approx):', bottoms.iloc[0], df['u'].min())\\nprint(bottoms.head(10))\\nprint(bottoms.tail(10))\\n\\\"\", \"description\": \"Analyze cabinet bottom in obs6\"}"}}]},"b3403094dec6879a722d465d2e7ddd97463408717dc5a39559095f7cc73341c2":{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"toolu_43b2fa4c265f4980a4071440946b9303","content":"Lamp shade in img1 bbox: (array([238, 238, 238, 238, 238, 238, 238, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239,\n       239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239, 239,\n       240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240,\n       240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 240, 241, 241, 241, 241, 241, 241, 241,\n       241, 241, 241, 241, 241, 241, 241, 241, 241, 241, 242, 242, 242,\n       242, 242, 242, 242, 242, 242, 242, 242, 242, 242, 242, 242, 243,\n       243, 243, 243, 243, 243, 243, 243, 243, 243, 243, 243, 243, 243,\n       244, 244, 244, 244, 244, 244, 244, 244, 244, 244, 244, 244, 244,\n       244, 245, 245, 245, 245, 245, 245, 245, 245, 245, 245, 245, 245,\n       246, 246, 246, 246, 246, 246, 246, 246, 246, 246, 246, 246, 247,\n       247, 247, 247, 247, 247, 247, 247, 247, 247, 247, 248, 248, 248,\n       248, 248, 248, 248, 248, 248, 248, 248, 249, 249, 249, 249, 249,\n       249, 249, 249, 249, 250, 250, 250, 250, 250, 250, 250, 250, 250,\n       251, 251, 251, 251, 251, 251, 251, 251, 252, 252, 252, 252, 252,\n       252, 252, 253, 253, 253, 253, 253, 253, 254, 254, 254, 254, 254,\n       254, 255, 255, 255, 255, 255, 256, 256, 256, 256, 257, 257, 257,\n       258, 258, 258]), array([360, 361, 362, 363, 364, 365, 366, 350, 351, 352, 353, 354, 355,\n       356, 357, 358, 359, 360, 361, 362, 363, 364, 365, 366, 367, 368,\n       350, 351, 352, 353